    "text": "By Vera Emoghene ,\n9 hours ago The Victoria’s Secret Fashion Show returns on October 15, 2025, streaming live at 7 p.m. ET across multiple platforms with an impressive lineup of legendary models and fresh faces. The iconic event will feature dramatic angel wings, sky-high heels, and the brand’s signature lingerie collections, bringing back the glamour that made the show a cultural phenomenon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
